  - name: Poster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31c95a69a85895349823cbc047401fc7, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Come and celebrate Neokalmar\u2019s 10th year anniversary!"
    - Celebrations will be held in the park of Neohuskvarna on the 6th June 2122.
